<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01468#child> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A young child, likely a toddler, standing in a bathroom. The child is barefoot, wearing light-colored diaper pants, and holding a small doll. The child has light brown hair and is looking directly at the camera with a neutral to slightly curious expression. The child is positioned next to a toilet with the lid up, and there is toilet paper strewn across the floor and sink, suggesting a messy or 'exploded' state."@en .
