<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01468#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for an audience familiar with internet meme culture, particularly those who understand the 'toilet explosion' trope and appreciate crude, exaggerated humor involving children and bodily mess. The use of political figures' names (Assad and Hamid) suggests the target audience includes those who follow political satire or trolling online, where such comparisons are common."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#complementaryTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
