<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01468#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses the word 'exploded' in reference to a child's bathroom mess, which can be interpreted as crude or vulgar, potentially insensitive or offensive when applied to children and bodily functions. The overall intent is to provoke laughter through shock value and absurd comparison, but the content may be perceived as harmful due to its crude or vulgar undertones."@en .
