_:nca66f29bc1864c069056b7d4ba722d66b19 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:nca66f29bc1864c069056b7d4ba722d66b20 .
_:nca66f29bc1864c069056b7d4ba722d66b76 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:nca66f29bc1864c069056b7d4ba722d66b77 .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Complementarity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dimensions working together to provide complete understanding through mutual supplementation in memes"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Speech-ThoughtIntegration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#DiegeticallyIntegrated> .
